===Dragon's Den===
[[File:Catacombs of Kourend - Dragon's Den.png|thumb|right|The Dragon's Den]]
The Dragon's Den is the north-western section of the Catacombs, where various draconic creatures can be found. It is the only location where [[brutal red dragon]]s and [[brutal black dragon]]s can be found. An adventurer named [[Kineer]] can also be found wandering here. The exit is found in the north-west corner with the brutal black dragons, leading to a hole north of [[The Deeper Lode]] pub in [[Lovakengj]].

Once the exit has been used, it can be quickly accessed via the "Xeric's Inferno" Teleport on the [[Xeric's talisman|Xeric's Talisman]] or the "Jewellery of Jubilation" teleport on [[Kharedst's memoirs]], which requires completion of [[The Forsaken Tower]] to use.

