===Reeking Cove===
[[File:Catacombs of Kourend - Reeking Cove.png|thumb|300px|The Reeking Cove]]
The Reeking Cove is the south-western section of the Catacombs, where various undead creatures can be found. It is the only location where [[deviant spectre]]s and [[twisted banshee]]s can be found. An unattackable [[Pirate (Catacombs of Kourend)|pirate]] can also be found wandering here. The exit is found in the southern area with the deviant spectres, which leads up to the hole north-west of the [[Shayzien Encampment]] bank.

Once the exit has been used, it can be quickly accessed via [[fairy ring]] {{Fairycode|djr}} and running east. Note: [[deviant spectre]]s at this entrance will lower your stats if not wearing a [[nose peg]] or [[slayer helmet]].

